          "path": "ARCHITECTURE.md",
          "repository": "memorax-ai/memorax-code",
          "url": "https://github.com/memorax-ai/memorax-code/blob/1525c20fbcad8c688bfaf4bb54dc117876fd6a09/ARCHITECTURE.md#L126-L138"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_66155440acb02137720411fa6ea6eade849f7692e52d0ce44e31826d8ed107c5",
        "slc_cef46135aedd93bc0d236be6c5dfeb7e118f2debdd8df01078fbb2cd6d6f5aa3"
      ],
      "text": "adapter-common is a shared source layer consumed by the Backend and all six adapters, providing connection primitives, credential storage, locks, and Hook transport; it is not an independently deployed service."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_33c49998aa682dd0b060d2ac0b03789410322cce02f10502e48299c9b766fc10",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "interfaces",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "1525c20fbcad8c688bfaf4bb54dc117876fd6a09",
          "git_sha": "f2d258bfca7cfe58a13e1dfef8bec6160781bac4",
          "line_end": 165,
          "line_start": 147,
          "path": "ARCHITECTURE.md",
          "repository": "memorax-ai/memorax-code",
          "url": "https://github.com/memorax-ai/memorax-code/blob/1525c20fbcad8c688bfaf4bb54dc117876fd6a09/ARCHITECTURE.md#L147-L165"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_7900528e3333855ab5e0356863ac034b3545f90c3541b81d6fc1e8e16622f740"
      ],
      "text": "Adapter Hooks and plugins communicate with the Backend via versioned, client-qualified local HTTP commands carrying JSON and token headers, with a request deadline and optional cancellation; the transport does not retry or start the Backend."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_00ef1fa849729e7a115af31d85fd43cd1fb0031427e120f1f4efca65a9467d02",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "memory-state",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "1525c20fbcad8c688bfaf4bb54dc117876fd6a09",
          "git_sha": "500dfcd6244af236674e99c9bd6bfe13a88381f9",
          "line_end": 240,
          "line_start": 235,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "memorax-ai/memorax-code",
          "url": "https://github.com/memorax-ai/memorax-code/blob/1525c20fbcad8c688bfaf4bb54dc117876fd6a09/README.md#L235-L240"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_5b6a0e0c080d93e85bc48440fb7b4af549e7b06f580ff12e163d1ddba6deeb26"
      ],
      "text": "Memory is divided into four categories: Coding Memory (engineering lessons), Repo Memory (repository knowledge), Personal Memory (user preferences), and Procedure Memory (reusable task steps)."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_6e76580d4a2d5f02c2872490438c8d5dd3af395e3f83599b0b98ede8ba8bf69b",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "memory-state",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "1525c20fbcad8c688bfaf4bb54dc117876fd6a09",
          "git_sha": "500dfcd6244af236674e99c9bd6bfe13a88381f9",
          "line_end": 250,
          "line_start": 242,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "memorax-ai/memorax-code",
          "url": "https://github.com/memorax-ai/memorax-code/blob/1525c20fbcad8c688bfaf4bb54dc117876fd6a09/README.md#L242-L250"
        }
      ],
      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_fb8e5bfec5e5b8458a1a6a597e36de4841d93994efcb86455239e5592ebeb207"
      ],
      "text": "Personal and Procedure Memory stay in the current repository under .repo_memory/; writes compare existing content so equivalent requests make no change and conflicts update or supersede entries."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_6a09ff5d063ad441a6116c83ff33e5750b49f3acfc6a16a9225f1e97e4c3b3e3",
      "evidence_type": "organizational_statement",
      "facet": "memory-state",
      "kind": "observation",
      "locators": [
        {
          "commit": "1525c20fbcad8c688bfaf4bb54dc117876fd6a09",
          "git_sha": "500dfcd6244af236674e99c9bd6bfe13a88381f9",
          "line_end": 278,
          "line_start": 272,
          "path": "README.md",
          "repository": "memorax-ai/memorax-code",
          "url": "https://github.com/memorax-ai/memorax-code/blob/1525c20fbcad8c688bfaf4bb54dc117876fd6a09/README.md#L272-L278"
