        "slc_bd6ea307481ed01f1ec50a11c8815d32daec2dc623576a5cc535422eaa8eb105"
      ],
      "text": "After setup, the managed Backend schedules a detached updater that locks, resolves a channel target, installs an exact published version via the package-replacement path, and reuses non-interactive setup reconciliation."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_2799c9f6f086415b6b0a5f59ed65bdede1342f137fd7f8f58fdd0c7e1af1c0ae",
