        "slc_cb8ef916c89484587f16b9cd61592a2e425505098afbb84951fcb9387d12afda"
      ],
      "text": "The package requires Node.js 20 or newer (Node 24 LTS recommended), and DeepSeek Harness releases require Node ^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0 with pnpm on PATH; MemoraX Code does not install or update DSH."
    },
