        "slc_581aa33d3019b1d5b2ba87a4d6541f273f167e2ff552f62f22c35f0eba3b4916"
      ],
      "text": "On Linux, guest credentials require /usr/bin/secret-tool from libsecret and an available Secret Service, and MemoraX search and writeback require network access."
    },
