      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_08b3134a7acf7c3005b81b9054f673203fafe2d3c98a7bb7962d125df4490772"
      ],
      "text": "Trae can use the Skill for Repo Memory but does not currently expose a headless worker for automatic Repo Memory maintenance, and automatic quota reminders are not listed for DeepSeek Harness."
    },
